  "scope": "Independent provider/runtime integration review including explicit OpenRouter Chat profile delta and retained OpenAI Responses adapter; deterministic default/mock native (27+2 each), transport5, provenance2 and real Qt7/14 process-pair checks. Reviewer used only synthetic credentials, no inference requests or private credential access. Public official model metadata/routing documentation verified separately. Refreshed on final audit-attribution/constructor-race correction; all five independent suites rerun on frozen source, full Qt7 passed in66.927s.",
